stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> CheckingMongo: run_pipeline.py
  CheckingMongo --> Failed: MongoDB unreachable
  CheckingMongo --> Generating: --generate or no raw data
  CheckingMongo --> Ingesting: raw data present
  Generating --> Ingesting
  Ingesting --> Cleaning: bronze DataFrames
  Cleaning --> Analytics: silver DataFrames + DQ report
  Analytics --> MachineLearning: gold collections written
  Analytics --> Logging: --skip-ml
  MachineLearning --> Logging: models + predictions written
  Ingesting --> Failed: exception
  Cleaning --> Failed: exception
  MachineLearning --> Failed: exception
  Failed --> Logging
  Logging --> [*]: pipeline_runs document saved
